1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,214
I accidentally ended a ten-year war...

2
00:00:02,334 --> 00:00:03,959
because I wanted a free horse!

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,321
I was exploring Ancient Greece when I found a massive wooden horse.

4
00:00:08,921 --> 00:00:11,576
Nobody was watching, so I decided to take it.

5
00:00:11,776 --> 00:00:14,750
I dragged it to Troy and told everyone it was a gift.

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,115
They loved it!

7
00:00:16,565 --> 00:00:18,209
They even threw a party for me!

8
00:00:21,176 --> 00:00:23,964
But that night, I heard someone sneeze inside the horse.

9
00:00:24,864 --> 00:00:25,548
Wait...

10
00:00:26,448 --> 00:00:28,051
wooden horses don't sneeze!

11
00:00:30,176 --> 00:00:33,597
I opened a tiny door, and dozens of Greek soldiers jumped out!

12
00:00:35,397 --> 00:00:37,917
Apparently, my free horse came with a free army!

13
00:00:42,876 --> 00:00:45,465
And that's how I accidentally helped destroy Troy.

14
00:00:47,065 --> 00:00:50,426
Next time, I'm checking the reviews before accepting free gifts!

15
00:00:54,276 --> 00:00:55,954
Subscribe to History World.

16
00:00:56,254 --> 00:00:57,853
History isn't safe with me!
